				"Placeholder"
				"By having a werewolf attack you and infect you with &oLupus Sanguinem, then sleeping while infected. When you wake up, you will be a werewolf.&r"
				"Werewolves are unique in that they only show their true strength at night and that they are only treated as a werewolf while transformed. In human form, you are treated like you aren't in any faction."
